---
import AppDocLayout from '../../layouts/AppDocLayout.astro';
---

<AppDocLayout
  title="Tic-Tac-Toe Easy - Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Tic-Tac-Toe Easy, the iOS game."
  ogUrl="https://idlefusion.com/tic-tac-toe-easy/privacy"
>
  <main>
    <section class="section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] mb-12">Tic-Tac-Toe Easy &middot; Effective October 23, 2026</p>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">The Short Version</h2>
            <p>Tic-Tac-Toe Easy does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data. Your games and scores stay on your iPhone.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Data Storage</h2>
            <p>Your scores, your game setup and your settings are stored on your iPhone in the app's own settings. You can clear your scores any time in Settings. There are no user accounts and no sign-up.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Analytics & Tracking</h2>
            <p>Tic-Tac-Toe Easy contains no analytics frameworks, no ad SDKs, no tracking pixels, and no telemetry of any kind. We do not use any third-party services that collect data.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Network Usage</h2>
            <p>Tic-Tac-Toe Easy makes no network requests. The only network activity associated with the app is the App Store, for updates. Links in Settings and About open in Safari or Mail only when you tap them.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Tic-Tac-Toe Easy does not knowingly collect any information from anyone, including children under the age of 13.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>If this policy changes, we will update this page with the new effective date. Since Tic-Tac-Toe Easy collects no data, meaningful changes are unlikely.</p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3">Contact</h2>
            <p>Questions about this privacy policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:support@idlefusion.com?subject=Tic-Tac-Toe%20Easy%20Privacy" class="text-[var(--accent-primary)] hover:underline">support@idlefusion.com</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</AppDocLayout>
